@startuml sl-02-checkin-handover
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 2 — Check-in, Physical Handover & Activation (Activity Swimlane)

|Storage Customer|
start
:Arrive at facility on scheduled check-in date;
:Present Digital Move-in Pass or Booking Code at reception desk;

|Facility Staff|
:Scan Move-in Pass QR code or lookup contract code in Staff Desk;
:Verify Customer Identity (Citizen ID / Passport) (BR-CHK-01);
:Escort customer to physical storage unit location;

|Storage Customer|
:Inspect storage unit condition alongside Facility Staff;

|Facility Staff|
:Evaluate 4-point handover criteria (Lock, Cleanliness, Lighting, Climate) (BR-CHK-02);

if (Storage unit satisfies all criteria & customer accepts?) then (accepted)
  :Take handover evidence photos and upload attachments;
  :Generate electronic HandoverRecord protocol;

  |Storage Customer|
  :Sign digital handover confirmation on tablet/mobile screen;

  |Facility Staff|
  :Confirm customer signature & complete handover in system;

  |System|
  :Transition RentalContract status: PENDING_CHECK_IN -> ACTIVE;
  :Transition StorageUnit status: RESERVED -> OCCUPIED;
  :Generate 6-digit secure access PIN code (BR-CHK-03);
  :Activate facility access gate credentials;
  :Send confirmation SMS/Email with PIN code to customer;

  |Storage Customer|
  :Receive active Smart Lock PIN code & begin self-storage usage;
  stop

else (defective unit / customer rejects)
  |Facility Staff|
  :Document defect details & customer rejection reason;
  if (Alternative vacant unit of same type available?) then (swap possible)
    :Trigger emergency unit swap workflow (BR-CHK-04);
    |System|
    :Reassign contract to new physical StorageUnit (BR-CHK-04);
    :Mark defective unit as MAINTENANCE / OUT_OF_SERVICE;
    |Facility Staff|
    :Escort customer to newly assigned unit & restart inspection;
    stop
  else (no alternative unit)
    :Cancel check-in & submit refund request;
    |System|
    :Transition contract to CANCELLED & initiate deposit refund (BR-CAN-03);
    stop
  endif
endif

|System|
note right
  **Auto-Activation Safety Cron (BR-CAN-04, BR-CHK-05):**
  If customer does not check in by T+11 days
  and does not cancel, system automatically
  activates contract to ACTIVE at 23:59:59 T+11
  to protect facility rental revenue.
end note
@enduml
